\"BlogsHeroCompanyNewsSubheading\":\"The latest news and announcements from AppLovin.\",\"BlogsHeroSuccessStoriesSubheading\":\"Real results from AppLovin customers.\",\"BlogsHeroEngineeringSubheading\":\"Engineering articles and deep dives from the AppLovin team.\",\"BlogsHeroTeamSubheading\":\"Meet the people behind AppLovin.\",\"BlogsHeroAcademySubheading\":\"Educational resources and guides from AppLovin Academy.\",\"BlogsSortDatePublished\":\"Date published\",\"BlogsFootnote\":\"This blog reflects how we think about building products and teams today. It shares perspectives and experiences rather than formal policies or commitments, and our approaches may evolve over time. Descriptions are intentionally high-level and are not meant to represent exhaustive technical, organizational, or product details. Blog posts speak as of the date published and are not subsequently reviewed or maintained. Posts may include forward-looking statements within the meaning of securities law relating to our business and strategies, which are subject to risks disclosed in our SEC filings.\",\"BlogsInTheNews\":\"In the news\",\"BlogsCategoryProductLabel\":\"Product\",\"BlogsCategoryProductListTitle\":\"Product Updates | AppLovin Blog\",\"BlogsCategoryProductListDescription\":\"Latest product updates from AppLovin.\",\"BlogsCategoryIndustryInsightsLabel\":\"Industry insights\",\"BlogsCategoryIndustryInsightsListTitle\":\"Industry Insights | AppLovin Blog\",\"BlogsCategoryIndustryInsightsListDescription\":\"Industry insights and trends from AppLovin.\",\"BlogsCategoryCompanyLabel\":\"Company\",\"BlogsCategoryCompanyListTitle\":\"Company News | AppLovin Blog\",\"BlogsCategoryCompanyListDescription\":\"The latest news and announcements from AppLovin.\",\"BlogsCategorySuccessStoriesLabel\":\"Success stories\",\"BlogsCategorySuccessStoriesListTitle\":\"Success Stories | AppLovin Blog\",\"BlogsCategorySuccessStoriesListDescription\":\"Real results from AppLovin customers.\",\"BlogsCategoryEn