ItemLaunch\":\"Go live today — no code, no delays.\",\"AdvertorialHighlightsItemCreative\":\"Turn ads on instantly — use your creatives or generate new ones in one click with our tools.\",\"AdvertorialHighlightsItemOptimize\":\"Only optimize for what matters: profitable revenue\",\"AdvertorialHighlightsItemScale\":\"You’ll know within days if this will scale — not months\",\"AdvertorialGetStarted\":\"Get started\",\"StandaloneGetStarted\":\"Get started\",\"StandaloneNeedSupport\":\"Need support?\",\"StandaloneContactUs\":\"Contact us\",\"StandaloneStartScaling\":\"Start scaling with AppLovin\",\"StandaloneDontMissOut\":\"Don’t miss out.\",\"StandaloneCreateAppLovinAccount\":\"Create your AppLovin account\",\"StandaloneGrowBusiness\":\"Grow your business\",\"StandaloneInviteOnlyHeadingLine1\":\"Forget best practices.\",\"StandaloneInviteOnlyHeadingLine2\":\"This is a new playbook.\",\"StandaloneInviteOnlySubtitle\":\"Transform your business with the most powerful advertising platform in a generation.\",\"CreativeGeneratorReferralReady\":\"Ready to test your new ads?\",\"BlogsAllPost\":\"All posts\",\"BlogsAuthorBy\":\"{{author}}\",\"BlogsLatest\":\"Latest\",\"BlogsSearchLabel\":\"Search\",\"BlogsSearchAriaLabel\":\"Search articles\",\"BlogsCategoryProduct\":\"Product\",\"BlogsCategoryIndustryInsights\":\"Industry insights\",\"BlogsCategoryCompany\":\"Company\",\"BlogsCategorySuccessStories\":\"Success stories\",\"BlogsCategoryEngineering\":\"Engineering\",\"BlogsCategoryTeam\":\"Team\",\"BlogsCategoryAcademy\":\"Learning\",\"CategoryHeroBlogEyebrow\":\"Blog\",\"CategoryHeroRcEyebrow\":\"Resource center\",\"RcAllResources\":\"All resources\",\"RcHeadingWord1\":\"Resource\",\"RcHeadingWord2\":\"center\",\"RcSubheading\":\"Materials to help you launch and scale with AppLovin Ads.\",\"RcEmptyState\":\"No {{category}} published yet.\",\"RcCategoryPopular\":\"Popular\",\"RcCategoryApplovinAds\":\"AppLovin Ads\",\"RcCategoryCampaigns\":\"Campaigns\",\"RcCategoryCreatives\":\"Creatives\",\"RcCategoryWebinars\":\"Webinars\",\"RcCategoryCaseStudies\":\"Case studies\",\"RcCategoryPopularDescription\":\"Our most popular resources.\",\"RcCategoryCaseStudiesDescription\":\"Explore AppLovin case studies.\",\"NewsEventsNewsTitle\":\"News\",\"NewsEventsEventsTitle\":\"Events\",\"NewsEventsAxonMentionsTitle\":\"Axon mentions\",\"FooterAccount\":\"Account\",\"FooterResources\":\"Resources\",\"FooterCompany\":\"Company\",\"FooterAbout\":\"About\",\"FooterNewsroom\":\"Newsroom\",\"FooterLeadership\":\"Leadership\",\"FooterCareers\":\"Careers\",\"FooterInvestors\":\"Investors\",\"FooterBrandGuidelines\":\"Brand Guidelines\",\"FooterBlog\":\"Blog\",\"FooterNewsAndEvents\":\"News \u0026 Events\",\"FooterSupport\":\"Support\",\"FooterWechatQRCodeTip\":\"Scan to follow\",\"FooterTermsOfUse\":\"Terms of Use\",\"FooterPrivacy\":\"Privacy\",\"FooterYourPrivacyChoices\":\"Your Privacy Choices\",\"FooterCaliforniaPrivacy\":\"Your California Privacy Choices\",\"FooterPolicyCenter\":\"Policy Center\",\"FooterPublisherPolicies\":\"Publisher Policies\",\"FooterDemandPartnerPolicies\":\"Demand Partner Policies\",\"FooterPlatformEnforcement\":\"Platform Enforcement\",\"FooterCookieSettings\":\"Cookie Settings\",\"NavAdvertise\":\"Advertise\",\"NavMonetize\":\"Monetize\",\"NavWhyMobileGames\":\"Why mobile games\",\"NavWhyMobileGamesInventoryTitle\":\"Mobile gaming inventory\",\"NavWhyMobileGamesInventoryDesc\":\"The games and who plays them\",\"NavWhyMobileGamesAdExpTitle\":\"AppLovin ad experience\",\"NavWhyMobileGamesAdExpDesc\":\"Fullscreen unskippable ads\",\"SectionLearn\":\"Learn\",\"SectionCompany\":\"Company\",\"NavLogIn\":\"Log in\",\"NavGetStarted\":\"Get started\",\"NavCreateAccount\":\"Create an account\",\"NavOpenMenu\":\"Open menu\",\"NavCloseMenu\":\"Close menu\",\"NavAdvertiseConsumerTitle\":\"Grow a consumer brand\",\"NavAdvertiseConsumerDesc\":\"Ecommerce, web businesses, consumer apps\",\"NavAdvertiseGamingTitle\":\"Scale a mobile gaming app\",\"NavAdvertiseGamingDesc\":\"Solo dev to major publisher\",\"NavBookACall\":\"Book a call\",\"NavBookACallPromoTag\":\"FREE SESSION\",\"NavBookACallPromoTitle\":\"30-min strategy call\",\"NavBookACallPromoDesc\":\"Get expert help launching on AppLovin Ads.\",\"NavBookACallPromoImageAlt\":\"Two people reviewing a campaign on a laptop\",\"NavProductAds\":\"Ads\",\"NavProductMax\":\"Max\",\"NavProductAdsDesc\":\"Grow your business\",\"NavProductMaxDesc\":\"Monetize your app\",\"NavGetStartedAds\":\"AppLovin Ads\",\"NavGetStartedMax\":\"AppLovin Max\",\"LinkBlog\":\"Blog\",\"LinkResources\":\"Resources\",\"LinkSupport\":\"Support\",\"LinkBrandGuidelines\":\"Brand guidelines\",\"LinkBookStrategyCall\":\"Book a strategy call\",\"LinkAdExperience\":\"Ad Experience\",\"LinkGameInventory\":\"Game Inventory\",\"LinkAbout\":\"About\",\"LinkCareers\":\"Careers\",\"LinkAffiliates\":\"Partner program\",\"LinkInvestors\":\"Investors\",\"LinkConsumerBrands\":\"Consumer brands\",\"LinkGamingApps\":\"Gaming apps\",\"LinkGoToDashboard\":\"Go to dashboard\",\"LinkShopifyApp\":\"Shopify app\",\"LinkPixelHelper\":\"Pixel helper\",\"LinkMonetization\":\"Monetization\",\"LinkAdjust\":\"Adjust\",\"LinkWurl\":\"Wurl\",\"FooterColAds\":\"Advertise\",\"FooterColMax\":\"Monetize\",\"FooterColMoreProducts\":\"More products\",\"FooterCookiesSettings\":\"Cookies Settings\",\"FooterAllRightsReserved\":\"All rights reserved.\",\"AboutHeroDescription\":\"AppLovin empowers people to build businesses bigger than they ever imagined.\",\"AboutTeamMarqueeTitle\":\"Want to join the team?\",\"CareersJoinTeamButton\":\"See open roles\",\"OtherSiteLinkAriaLabel\":\"Other AppLovin destinations\",\"OtherSiteLinkCompanyNewsTitle\":\"Company news\",\"OtherSiteLinkCompanyNewsDescription\":\"Latest updates from AppLovin.\",\"OtherSiteLinkInvestorsTitle\":\"Investors\",\"OtherSiteLinkInvestorsDescription\":\"Financial information and investor resources.\",\"OtherSiteLinkCareersTitle\":\"Careers\",\"OtherSiteLinkCareersDescription\":\"Explore open roles and life at AppLovin.\",\"OtherSiteLinkCta\":\"Learn more\",\"AboutPrincipleHeading\":\"Great products win\",\"AboutPrincipleProductFirstTitle\":\"Performance, not pitches\\n\\n\",\"AboutPrincipleProductFirstDescription\":\"We invest in making the best possible advertising platform, not in sales presentations.\",\"AboutPrinciplePunchAboveTitle\":\"Built for any size business\",\"AboutPrinciplePunchAboveDescription\":\"Our customers don’t need to be marketing experts. If you have a great product, AppLovin scales it.\",\"AboutPrincipleMathTitle\":\"The math has to work\",\"AboutPrincipleMathDescription\":\"For every dollar an advertiser spends, they have to make more on the other side. And advertisers spend over $11B on our platform annually.\\n\\n\",\"AboutQuoteText\":\"We don't sell the belief that something worked. We sell the actual fact that something worked, and we can measure everything.\",\"AboutQuoteAuthor\":\"Adam Foroughi\",\"AboutQuoteAuthorTitle\":\"Founder \u0026 CEO of AppLovin\",\"AboutFromBeginToCurrentHeading\":\"AppLovin was founded in 2012 by a handful of performance marketers with an $8 domain.\",\"AboutFromBeginToCurrentCard1Body\":\"Over the past 14 years, we've built one of the largest advertising platforms in the world — by doing one thing relentlessly well: helping small businesses become big.\",\"AboutFromBeginToCurrentCard2Body\":\"Early on, we partnered with indie studios and helped them grow into 9- and 10-figure giants. We grew the mobile gaming industry, and AppLovin grew with it.\",\"AboutFromBeginToCurrentCard3Body\":\"Today, AppLovin powers the vast majority of major mobile games. Now we’re doing for consumer brands what we did for indie game studios — and we're just getting started.\",\"AboutHeroTitle\":\"We grow businesses profitably\",\"AboutLinksCompanyNewsTitle\":\"Blog\",\"AboutLinksCompanyNewsBody\":\"Stay up to date with the latest AppLovin announcements, partnerships, and milestones.\",\"AboutLinksCompanyNewsCta\":\"Learn more\",\"AboutLinksInvestorsTitle\":\"Investors\",\"AboutLinksInvestorsBody\":\"Financial results, SEC filings, and resources for AppLovin shareholders.\",\"AboutLinksInvestorsCta\":\"Learn more\",\"AboutLinksLeadershipTitle\":\"Leadership\",\"AboutLinksLeadershipBody\":\"Meet the team behind AppLovin's mission to power the mobile economy.\",\"AboutLinksLeadershipCta\":\"Learn more\",\"AboutMilestoneFoundedBarLabel\":\"Founded\",\"AboutMilestoneFoundedTitle\":\"Founded\",\"AboutMilestoneFoundedDescription\":\"Bootstrapped, so we’ve been focused on profitability from the beginning.\",\"AboutMilestoneFirstRevenueBarLabel\":\"First $1M revenue\",\"AboutMilestoneFirstRevenueTitle\":\"First $1M revenue\",\"AboutMilestoneFirstRevenueDescription\":\"Profitable within 8 months. $1M/month run rate.\",\"AboutMilestoneTurnedDownBarLabel\":\"Turned down $600M\",\"AboutMilestoneTurnedDownTitle\":\"Turned down $600M\",\"AboutMilestoneTurnedDownDescription\":\"Turned down a $600M all-cash acquisition offer to keep building.\",\"AboutMilestoneStudiosAcquiredBarLabel\":\"Studios, acquired\",\"AboutMilestoneStudiosAcquiredTitle\":\"Game studio acquisitions\",\"AboutMilestoneStudiosAcquiredDescription\":\"Started buying game studios to train our models on first-party data.\",\"AboutMilestoneAxon1BarLabel\":\"Axon 1.0 goes live\",\"AboutMilestoneAxon1Title\":\"Axon 1.0 goes live\",\"AboutMilestoneAxon1Description\":\"Launched first Axon machine learning model.\",\"AboutMilestoneIpoBarLabel\":\"IPO'd at $28B\",\"AboutMilestoneIpoTitle\":\"IPO'd at $28B\",\"AboutMilestoneIpoDescription\":\"IPO'd at a $28B valuation. Nasdaq: APP.\",\"AboutMilestoneEbitdaBarLabel\":\"$$1B+ EBITDA\",\"AboutMilestoneEbitdaTitle\":\"$$1B+ EBITDA\",\"AboutMilestoneEbitdaDescription\":\"Generated $1B+ EBITDA.\",\"AboutMilestoneAxon2BarLabel\":\"Launched Axon 2.0\",\"AboutMilestoneAxon2Title\":\"Launched Axon 2.0\",\"AboutMilestoneAxon2Description\":\"Launched Axon 2.0, accelerating revenue growth for us and our customers.\",\"AboutMilestoneAllInOnAdsBarLabel\":\"Ecommerce pilot\",\"AboutMilestoneAllInOnAdsTitle\":\"Ecommerce pilot\",\"AboutMilestoneAllInOnAdsDescription\":\"Onboarded our first ecommerce clients to our ad platform\",\"AboutMilestoneStudiosSoldBarLabel\":\"All in on ads\",\"AboutMilestoneStudiosSoldTitle\":\"All in on ads\",\"AboutMilestoneStudiosSoldDescription\":\"Sold portfolio of game studios to fully focus on our ad platform.\",\"AboutMilestoneAdsDemocratizedBarLabel\":\"Invite-only launch\",\"AboutMilestoneAdsDemocratizedTitle\":\"Invite-only launch\",\"AboutMilestoneAdsDemocratizedDescription\":\"Launched self-service ad platform on a referral basis.\",\"AboutMilestoneAdsForAllBarLabel\":\"Helping any business grow\",\"AboutMilestoneAdsForAllTitle\":\"Helping any business grow\",\"AboutMilestoneAdsForAllDescription\":\"Opened AppLovin Ads to all advertisers.\",\"AboutMilestoneSectionTitle\":\"What we've accomplished\",\"AboutMilestoneSectionTitleDesktop\":\"What we've accomplished\",\"ConsumerBrandsHeroTitle\":\"Find your next million customers\",\"ConsumerBrandsHeroBody\":\"Your customers are playing mobile games. We'll introduce you.\",\"ConsumerBrandsHeroPrimaryLabel\":\"Get started\",\"ConsumerBrandsLogoBarTitle\":\"Loved by leading brands \",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqQuestion1\":\"What types of products can I advertise on AppLovin?\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer1\":\"AppLovin Ads supports sales of physical ecommerce products, as well as digital products, subscriptions, and services across web and app businesses.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqQuestion2\":\"What do I need to get started?\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer2Paragraph1\":\"Getting started is easy. For web advertisers, install the AppLovin Pixel through the Shopify App Store or Google Tag Manager. For app advertisers, integrate your MMP. Then set up your campaign and define your goal and budget. Upload your existing creative assets and use AppLovin’s AI ad generation tools to build additional assets. Once you launch, AppLovin Ads automatically targets the right users and optimizes toward your goal.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer2Paragraph2\":\"Once you launch, AppLovin Ads automatically targets the right users and optimizes toward your goal.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqQuestion3\":\"What budget do I need to get started?\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer3\":\"You can launch on AppLovin Ads with a budget as low as $10/day. Launch campaigns with a budget that fits your business and scale as you see results.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqQuestion4\":\"Can I use the creatives I'm already running elsewhere?\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer4Paragraph1\":\"Yes. You can upload your existing creative assets, including videos and images, into creative sets on AppLovin Ads.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer4Paragraph2\":\"For best results, we recommend uploading as many creatives as possible. Greater volume and variety give AppLovin Ads more to evaluate, allowing it to select and show the best-performing ad for each impression.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqQuestion5\":\"Where do AppLovin ads show up?\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqAnswer5\":\"Ads appear in a variety of top-rated mobile games, including Subway Surfers, Candy Crush, Sudoku, Solitaire, and Words With Friends.\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqFootnote\":\"2025 Applovin analysis of 95 brands\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceTitle\":\"Your customers play mobile games\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard1Header\":\"1 billion+ people game every day\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard1Title\":\"Over an hour of daily play\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard1Body\":\"Mobile gamers are mainstream consumers with real buying power. Most spend over an hour a day playing while commuting, between meetings, and waiting in line.\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard1CTA\":\"Reach your customers\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard2Header\":\"They're focused, not scrolling\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard2Title\":\"Distraction-free environment\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard2Body\":\"Games hold attention on one screen at a time. No feed to scroll, nothing competing for attention - just a relaxed, locked-in window.\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard2CTA\":\"Get undivided attention\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard3Header\":\"And they pay attention to ads\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard3Title\":\"35 seconds median engagement\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard3Body\":\"AppLovin Ads are fullscreen videos shown between levels or that people choose to watch in exchange for rewards.\",\"ConsumerBrandsAudienceCard3CTA\":\"Tell your brand's story\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesTitle\":\"Set your growth target.\\nThen exceed it.\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesBody\":\"Choose the outcome that matters most to your business and watch it become your new baseline.\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesPrimaryLabel\":\"Get started\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesRoasTitle\":\"ROAS\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesRoasBody\":\"Maximize revenue from every dollar you spend.\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesPurchasesTitle\":\"Purchases\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesPurchasesBody\":\"Drive purchases of any size at or below your target cost.\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesLeadsTitle\":\"Leads\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesLeadsBody\":\"Reach people most likely to be qualified prospects.\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesInAppEventsTitle\":\"In-app events\",\"ConsumerBrandsObjectivesInAppEventsBody\":\"Optimize for the actions that matter inside your app.\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachTitle\":\"Choose who you reach\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachDescription\":\"Whether you want to maximize overall scale or break into new audiences, AppLovin’s AI engine finds customers who fit your goals.\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachUniversalTitle\":\"Universal\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachUniversalBody\":\"Maximize ROAS or purchases across all customer types, regardless of prior purchase history.\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachProspectingTitle\":\"Prospecting\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachProspectingBody\":\"Convert net-new customers. Grow your customer base or new-customer revenue.\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachDiscoveryTitle\":\"Discovery\",\"ConsumerBrandsReachDiscoveryBody\":\"Reach people who've never visited your site and turn them into first-time customers.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupWebsiteStep1Title\":\"Connect your\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupWebsiteStep1Description\":\"Integrate the AppLovin Pixel through the Shopify App Store or Google Tag Manager.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupWebsiteStep2Title\":\"Upload your creatives\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupWebsiteStep2Description\":\"Bring your videos, statics, and playables. The more creative variety you provide, the faster the engine can identify what performs best.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupWebsiteStep3Title\":\"Set up and launch\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupWebsiteStep3Description\":\"Launch your first campaign in minutes. Set your goals and budget, and AppLovin Ads automatically optimizes bidding, targeting, and creative selection.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupAppStep1Title\":\"Connect your app\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupAppStep1Description\":\"Integrate with AppsFlyer, Adjust, Singular, Kochava, Tenjin, or Branch to start measuring performance and campaign outcomes.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupAppStep2Title\":\"Upload your creatives\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupAppStep2Description\":\"Bring your videos and playables. The more creative variety you provide, the faster the engine can identify what performs best.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupAppStep3Title\":\"Set up and launch\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupAppStep3Description\":\"Launch your first campaign in minutes. Set your goals and budget, and AppLovin Ads automatically optimizes bidding, targeting, and creative selection\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupTabWebsite\":\"Website\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupTabApp\":\"App\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupTitle\":\"Go live in under an hour\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupBody\":\"No complex setup. No expertise needed.\",\"ConsumerBrandsSetupPrimaryLabel\":\"Get started\",\"ConsumerBrandsStatsGalleryStat1Body\":\"of web conversions happen\\nwithin 24 hours of click\",\"ConsumerBrandsStatsGalleryStat2Body\":\"in daily ad spend reached within days of launch\",\"ConsumerBrandsStatsGalleryStat3Body\":\"of web brands see higher customer LTV with AppLovin vs. other platforms \u003csup\u003e1\u003c/sup\u003e\",\"GamingAppsCreativeSlideMeasurementTitle\":\"Connect your measurement partner\",\"GamingAppsCreativeSlideMeasurementDescription\":\"Integrate with AppsFlyer, Adjust, Singular, Kochava, Tenjin, or Branch to start measuring performance and campaign outcomes.\",\"GamingAppsCreativeSlideUploadTitle\":\"Upload your creatives\",\"GamingAppsCreativeSlideUploadDescription\":\"Bring your videos and playables. The more creative variety you provide, the faster the engine can identify what performs best.\",\"GamingAppsCreativeSlideLaunchTitle\":\"Set up and launch\",\"GamingAppsCreativeSlideLaunchDescription\":\"Set your optimization strategy, define your targets, and launch. AppLovin automatically optimizes bidding, targeting, and creative selection.\",\"GamingAppsHeroTitle\":\"From sleeper hit to global chart topper\",\"GamingAppsHeroBody\":\"Whether you're launching your first title or scaling your next breakout hit, profitable players at massive scale are within reach.\",\"GamingAppsHeroPrimaryLabel\":\"Get started\",\"GamingAppsScrollSliderTitle\":\"Launch fast. Scale faster.\",\"GamingAppsScrollSliderBody\":\"No complex setup. No expertise needed.\",\"GamingAppsScrollSliderPrimaryLabel\":\"Get started\",\"GamingAppsFaqRoasGrowthQuestion\":\"Should I expect to grow my app further with ad-based ROAS campaigns?\",\"GamingAppsFaqRoasGrowthAnswer\":\"Yes. Ad-based ROAS campaigns help publishers scale by optimizing toward users who generate short and long-term ad revenue.\",\"GamingAppsFaqBusinessImpactQuestion\":\"Can the impact be significant enough to change the trajectory of my business?\",\"GamingAppsFaqBusinessImpactAnswer\":\"For many studios, yes. AppLovin has helped games grow from early traction to global scale through compounding monetization and user acquisition growth loops.\",\"GamingAppsFaqGetStartedQuestion\":\"What do I need to start running Ad ROAS campaigns with AppLovin Ads?\",\"GamingAppsFaqGetStartedAnswer\":\"You'll need a live app, Max integrated for monetization, an MMP, creative assets, and a defined campaign goal.\",\"GamingAppsFaqScaleGamesQuestion\":\"Can AppLovin Ads campaigns scale all types of games?\",\"GamingAppsFaqScaleGamesAnswer\":\"Yes, whether your game is ad-monetized, IAP-driven, or a hybrid of both, AppLovin has a campaign type built for your business model.\",\"GamingAppsFaqCostQuestion\":\"Does AppLovin Ads cost money to use?\",\"GamingAppsFaqCostAnswer\":\"There are no upfront platform fees to get started. You control your campaign budgets and only pay for the advertising spend you run through the platform.\",\"GamingAppsFaqPoliciesQuestion\":\"Is my app a fit for AppLovin Ads?\",\"GamingAppsFaqPoliciesAnswer\":\"AppLovin supports a wide range of gaming apps. Before launching campaigns, apps are reviewed to ensure they meet our \u003clink\u003epolicies for demand partners\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"GamingAppsJourneySoftLaunchTitle\":\"Soft launch\",\"GamingAppsJourneySoftLaunchBody\":\"Test marketability, find your best creatives, and identify the audiences that convert.\",\"GamingAppsJourneyGlobalLaunchTitle\":\"Global launch\",\"GamingAppsJourneyGlobalLaunchBody\":\"Expand your reach, attract high-value players, and grow your user base worldwide.\",\"GamingAppsJourneyHyperscaleTitle\":\"Hyperscale\",\"GamingAppsJourneyHyperscaleBody\":\"Smarter optimization and advanced targeting that keeps mature games growing.\",\"GamingAppsJourneyTitle\":\"Every stage. One engine.\",\"GamingAppsJourneyBody\":\"Wherever you are in your growth journey, AppLovin will help you get to the next level.\",\"GamingAppsMaxGrowthCardTitle\":\"Use Max and AppLovin Ads together\",\"GamingAppsMaxGrowthCardBody\":\"Your revenue should work as hard as you do. Reinvest earnings from Max into user acquisition with AppLovin Ads and turn momentum into chart-climbing growth.\",\"GamingAppsMaxGrowthCardCtaLabel\":\"Learn more about Max\",\"GamingAppsMaxGrowthTitle\":\"Put your revenue to work\",\"GamingAppsMaxGrowthBody\":\"Monetization and user acquisition aren't separate problems. They're the same engine.\",\"GamingAppsStatsTitle\":\"Big reach for studios with big ambitions\",\"GamingAppsStatsDauBody\":\"Daily active users across 10,000+ apps\",\"GamingAppsStatsAdFormatEyebrow\":\"up to\",\"GamingAppsStatsAdFormatBody\":\"Fullscreen video \u0026 playable ad formats\",\"GamingAppsStatsAdSpendBody\":\"Annual ad spend on AppLovin Ads\",\"GamingAppsStrategyTitle\":\"Every game grows differently. Your UA strategy should too.\",\"GamingAppsStrategyBody\":\"AppLovin optimizes for the outcomes that fit your growth strategy.\",\"GamingAppsStrategyAdRoasTag\":\"Ad ROAS\",\"GamingAppsStrategyAdRoasTitle\":\"Maximize ad revenue\",\"GamingAppsStrategyAdRoasBody\":\"For ad-monetized games focused on maximizing player lifetime ad revenue.\",\"GamingAppsStrategyIapRoasTag\":\"IAP ROAS\",\"GamingAppsStrategyIapRoasTitle\":\"Drive in-app purchases\",\"GamingAppsStrategyIapRoasBody\":\"For games driven by in-app purchases and long-term player value.\",\"GamingAppsStrategyBlendedRoasTag\":\"BLENDED ROAS\",\"GamingAppsStrategyBlendedRoasTitle\":\"Hybrid monetization\",\"GamingAppsStrategyBlendedRoasBody\":\"Turn engagement into durable revenue with the industry's leading monetization stack.\",\"GamingAppsStrategyCostPerPurchaseTag\":\"COST PER PURCHASE\",\"GamingAppsStrategyCostPerPurchaseTitle\":\"Efficient conversions\",\"GamingAppsStrategyCostPerPurchaseBody\":\"Ideal for subscription or purchase-driven titles focused on efficient conversion.\",\"GamingAppsStrategyCostPerEventTag\":\"COST PER EVENT\",\"GamingAppsStrategyCostPerEventTitle\":\"Meaningful milestones\",\"GamingAppsStrategyCostPerEventBody\":\"Toward meaningful player milestones like tutorial completion, achievements, or first-session length.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialHappybitsQuote\":\"Revenue is up 300% and multiple titles have ranked high on global game store charts. AppLovin's Ads and Max have been the engine behind every milestone.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialHappybitsName\":\"Serena Sa\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialHappybitsTitle\":\"VP Marketing, Happybits\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialLoomGamesQuote\":\"By utilizing AppLovin Ads to scale our hybrid-casual model, we grew total revenue by an average of 195% month-over-month leading up to the deal, helping transform Loom Games into one of the fastest-growing studios in mobile gaming.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialLoomGamesName\":\"Kübra Gündoğan\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialLoomGamesTitle\":\"CEO, Loom Games\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialHungryStudioQuote\":\"We've achieved remarkable growth in advertising spend and performance, including +200% Y/Y on top of an already successful business.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialHungryStudioName\":\"Jerry Yang\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialHungryStudioTitle\":\"VP of Product Strategy, Hungry Studio\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialBurneyGamesQuote\":\"With AppLovin Ads and Max, we’ve scaled multiple titles profitably, surpassed 45M downloads, increased revenue 5x, and reached more than 5M monthly active users. Powered by AppLovin Ads, our flagship game, Colorwood Sort, climbed into the Top 20 overall games on the U.S. App Store.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialBurneyGamesName\":\"Anatolii Henis\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialBurneyGamesTitle\":\"CEO, Burney Games\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialBravestartsQuote\":\"AppLovin has been one of our largest partners across both UA and monetization. Together, we have grown the business by more than 450%, driven by global hit titles such as Yarn Fever and Fruit Merge.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialBravestartsName\":\"Duc Le\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialBravestartsTitle\":\"CEO, Bravestars\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialTap4funQuote\":\"Within two months of working with AppLovin, they had already helped us scale spend by over seven figures, and our revenue increased by more than 25%.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialTap4funName\":\"Jinge Zhang\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialTap4funTitle\":\"UA Director, Tap4fun\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialGrandGamesQuote\":\"Before we had meaningful results, AppLovin was already treating us like a serious partner — dedicated account manager, responsive support, the works. It showed me that great platform companies evaluate teams, ambition, and trajectory, not just current numbers. Today, hits like Block Out! and Car Match rank on the Top Grossing and Top Download charts — and we’ve grown revenue 87% quarter-over-quarter.\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialGrandGamesName\":\"Batuhan Çelebi\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialGrandGamesTitle\":\"CEO, Grand Games\",\"GamingAppsTestimonialTitle\":\"Your growth story starts here\",\"HomeClientShowcaseGridAriaLabel\":\"Client examples — drag to scroll\",\"HomeClientShowcaseGridHeading\":\"Let's get you in front of 1B+ customers\",\"HomeClientShowcaseGridBody\":\"Mobile gamers are mainstream consumers who shop, decide, and buy. \\nThe majority play over an hour every day — time you're not reaching them in any other channel.\",\"HomeInlineImageHighlightTitle\":\"The whole screen. Every time.\",\"HomeInlineImageHighlightBody\":\"Every ad runs fullscreen during natural pauses in the game experience or are chosen in exchange for rewards. No scrolling past, no swiping away, no fighting for attention in a feed.\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerTitle\":\"Let's get you in front of a billion customers\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerSubtitle\":\"We built AppLovin for businesses like yours. Jewelry, furniture, fitness subscriptions, word games. Whatever it is, we'll help you scale it.\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerConsumerTitle\":\"For consumer brands\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerConsumerBody\":\"Drive purchases, signups, and subscriptions on your website or app.\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerConsumerCta\":\"Acquire customers\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerGamingTitle\":\"For gaming apps\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerGamingBody\":\"Acquire high-LTV players at scale across diverse game genres.\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerGamingPrimaryCta\":\"Grow your user base\",\"HomeOurTargetCustomerGamingSecondaryCta\":\"Earn from your game\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasLabel\":\"ROAS\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasCardTitle\":\"ROAS\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasCardBody\":\"Maximize revenue from every dollar you spend.\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasOptionLabel\":\"ROAS\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasOptionSublabel\":\"In-App purchase return on ad spend\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasBlendedOptionLabel\":\"ROAS (Blended)\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailRoasBlendedOptionSublabel\":\"Total return on ad spend\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailPurchaseLabel\":\"Purchase\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailPurchaseCardTitle\":\"Purchase\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailPurchaseCardBody\":\"Drive purchases of any size at or below your target cost.\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCpiOptionLabel\":\"CPI\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCpiOptionSublabel\":\"Cost Per Install\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCppOptionLabel\":\"CPP\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCppOptionSublabel\":\"Cost Per Purchase\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailLeadsLabel\":\"Leads\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailLeadsCardTitle\":\"Leads\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailLeadsCardBody\":\"Reach people most likely to be qualified prospects.\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCplOptionLabel\":\"CPL\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCplOptionSublabel\":\"Cost Per Lead\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailInAppLabel\":\"In app events\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailInAppCardTitle\":\"In-app events\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailInAppCardBody\":\"Optimize for the actions that matter inside your app.\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCpeOptionLabel\":\"CPE\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailCpeOptionSublabel\":\"Cost Per Event\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailHeading\":\"Achieve the outcomes that matter most\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailSubhead\":\"Pick the outcome that moves the needle for your business and AppLovin will achieve it.\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailTabsAriaLabel\":\"Outcome types\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailOptimizationHeading\":\"Optimization\",\"HomeTabbedImageDetailGoalTypeLabel\":\"Goal type\",\"HomeTextImageCardsGalleryItem1Name\":\"Game District\",\"HomeTextImageCardsGalleryItem2Name\":\"Shapermint Essentials\",\"HomeTextImageCardsGalleryItem3Name\":\"Game District\",\"HomeTextImageCardsGalleryItem10Name\":\"Resident Home\",\"HomeTextImageCardsAzurGamesName\":\"Azur Games\",\"HomeTextImageCardsTitleWordLeft\":\"Transforming\",\"HomeTextImageCardsTitleWordRight\":\"businesses\",\"HomeTextImageCardsTitleBottom\":\"for over a decade\",\"MonetizationFaqQuestionFree\":\"Is Max free to use?\",\"MonetizationFaqAnswerFree\":\"Yes. Max mediation is free for publishers. Bidding networks pay AppLovin a fee on generated ad revenue.\",\"MonetizationFaqQuestionRevenueLift\":\"Will my revenue go up when I switch to Max?\",\"MonetizationFaqAnswerRevenueLift\":\"Most publishers see a meaningful lift in eCPMs when switching to Max, driven by more demand sources competing simultaneously for every ad impression opportunity.\",\"MonetizationFaqQuestionIntegrationTime\":\"How long does it take to integrate Max?\",\"MonetizationFaqAnswerIntegrationTime\":\"Most publishers can integrate Max in less than a day. Developer tools, including automated integration, SDK validation, and pre-launch ad testing with the Mediation Debugger make the process fast and straightforward.\",\"MonetizationFaqQuestionNoUa\":\"I don’t run UA campaigns. Will Max still maximize my revenue?\",\"MonetizationFaqAnswerNoUa\":\"Yes. The 360 growth approach is available to Max publishers, but not required. Max’s unified auction maximizes the revenue per user regardless of whether you run UA campaigns.\",\"MonetizationFaqQuestionAuctionFair\":\"Is the auction fair? Does AppLovin’s own demand get preferential treatment?\",\"MonetizationFaqAnswerAuctionFair\":\"Every network, including AppLovin, competes on equal footing in the unified auction. The highest bid always wins, regardless of the source. All bidding networks receive the same auction signals to bid competitively.\",\"MonetizationFaqQuestionEligibility\":\"Is my app eligible for Max?\",\"MonetizationFaqAnswerEligibility\":\"Max supports apps across all major genres and categories. Please refer to AppLovin’s \u003clink\u003ePublisher Policies\u003c/link\u003e to determine the eligibility of the app. Your account or support team can help determine eligibility.\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceHeading\":\"Ensure a positive ad experience\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceAutoDetectionTitle\":\"Automatic detection\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceAutoDetectionBody\":\"Problematic and competitor ads are automatically flagged.\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceChipReviewComplete\":\"Review complete\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceChipCompetitorDetected\":\"Competitor detected\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceChipAdRemoved\":\"Ad removed!\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceQualityControlTitle\":\"Ad quality control\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceQualityControlBody\":\"Ad Review gives you full visibility and control over which ads your users see.\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceFullTransparencyTitle\":\"Full transparency\",\"MonetizationAdExperienceFullTransparencyBody\":\"Audit the complete user ad journey to address app store reviews and support inquiries.\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsRewardedVideoTitle\":\"Rewarded Video\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsRewardedVideoBody\":\"A fullscreen ad that users watch in exchange for an in-app reward.\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsAppOpenTitle\":\"App Open\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsAppOpenBody\":\"An ad shown when the app is opened or when users return after using another app.\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsInterstitialTitle\":\"Interstitial\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsInterstitialBody\":\"A fullscreen ad displayed at natural transition points, such as between screens or levels.\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsMrecTitle\":\"MREC\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsMrecBody\":\"A 300×250px banner ad embedded directly within a game's UI, typically displayed in pause screens\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsBannerTitle\":\"Banner\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsBannerBody\":\"A standard ad unit with text and image\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsNativeTitle\":\"Native\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsNativeBody\":\"Native ads are fully customizable system-initiated ad units that appear as a seamless part of your app's design.\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsHeading\":\"Ads that fit your game\",\"MonetizationAdFormatsBody\":\"Max supports every major ad format, giving you the flexibility to monetize in ways that feel natural for your game and audience.\",\"MonetizationGameValueTitle\":\"Maximize your ad revenue\",\"MonetizationGameValueParagraphOne\":\"Every time a user sees an ad, Max runs a real-time auction where networks compete and the highest bid wins.\",\"MonetizationGameValueParagraphTwo\":\"As more advertisers discover your audience, competition grows and every impression becomes more valuable.\",\"MonetizationHeroTitle\":\"Made a cool app?\\nTurn it into a business.\",\"MonetizationHeroBody\":\"AppLovin Max’s powerful monetization tools help games of all sizes earn more from every impression.\",\"MonetizationHeroCtaLabel\":\"Unlock more revenue\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepIntegrateNav\":\"Integrate\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepIntegrateTitle\":\"Lightweight SDK\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepIntegrateBody\":\"Easy to integrate, easy to test, and built to keep latency low.\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepConnectNav\":\"Connect\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepConnectTitle\":\"Streamlined integration\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepConnectBody\":\"All major platforms and engines supported. Unity developers integrate in a few clicks.\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepLaunchNav\":\"Launch\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepLaunchTitle\":\"Simplified QA\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterStepLaunchBody\":\"QA each SDK in minutes and test ads from every network before launch.\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterHeading\":\"Launch faster. Start earning sooner.\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterBody\":\"You don’t need to be the biggest app in the store to earn like one, and setup is easier than you think.\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterCtaLabel\":\"Start monetizing with Max\",\"MonetizationLaunchFasterNavAriaLabel\":\"Setup steps\",\"MonetizationLogoArcDialAriaLabel\":\"Partner game studios on AppLovin Max\",\"MonetizationLogoArcMarkAlt\":\"AppLovin Max\",\"MonetizationLogoArcTitle\":\"Your game already has value.\\nMax unlocks more of it.\",\"MonetizationNextLiftReportingTitle\":\"Advanced reporting tools\",\"MonetizationNextLiftReportingBody\":\"Access user and impression-level data through built-in reporting tools or API to uncover your next opportunity.\",\"MonetizationNextLiftMmpTitle\":\"MMP integrations\",\"MonetizationNextLiftMmpBody\":\"Connect with AppsFlyer, Adjust, Singular, Kochava, Tenjin, or Branch to track and optimize performance from day one.\",\"MonetizationNextLiftAbTestingTitle\":\"Built-in A/B testing\",\"MonetizationNextLiftAbTestingBody\":\"Test networks, price points, and regional setups to find what earns most for your game.\",\"MonetizationNextLiftHeading\":\"Find your next lift\",\"MonetizationNextLiftBody\":\"Big growth often starts as small signals in the data. Max helps you catch more of them.\",\"MonetizationRevenueTitle\":\"Put your revenue to work\",\"MonetizationRevenueBody\":\"Reinvest earnings into Ad ROAS campaigns on AppLovin Ads, where signals from Max help you acquire higher value users, drive more revenue, and scale your game.\",\"MonetizationRevenueCtaLabel\":\"Learn more\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideOneQuote\":\"AppLovin unlocked a level of global scale we couldn't have reached alone, with MAX driving 751% Y/Y monetization growth while we scaled UA with AppLovin Ads.\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideOneName\":\"TBD\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideOneTitle\":\"CEO at Game District\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideTwoQuote\":\"When we switched to AppLovin, we were a 4-person studio doing under $2M a year. They powered both our UA and monetization as we scaled — today, we're well into eight figures annually.\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideTwoName\":\"Michael Martinez\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideTwoTitle\":\"CEO at FunCraft\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideThreeQuote\":\"AppLovin has been critical to our growth, powering the majority of our UA and monetization through Max, helping us achieve an annual average growth rate of over 100%.”\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideThreeName\":\"Seyoung Yoon\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsSlideThreeTitle\":\"CGO of Supercent\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsRedInfinityQuote\":\"With Max, we achieved 350% YoY revenue growth while scaling user acquisition by 350% YoY, all while maintaining strong, consistent ROI and significantly improving overall efficiency. AppLovin has consistently delivered outstanding performance, accounting for more than 50% of our total budget.\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsRedInfinityName\":\"Yuliang Yan\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsRedInfinityTitle\":\"COO at Red Infinity\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsWedobestQuote\":\"By leveraging both Max and AppLovin Ads, we unlocked a system where UA data continuously improves monetization efficiency, while monetization signals sharpen the UA model. This approach helped us achieve more than 10x growth across monetization and UA spend, alongside a 20% uplift in overall ROI.\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsWedobestName\":\"Hongkun Zhang\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsWedobestTitle\":\"CMO at Wedobest\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsLumosFunQuote\":\"We began our partnership with AppLovin, and our ad spend scaled by 7x YoY. Powered by the complete growth flywheel of Max for monetization and Ads Manager’s ROAS-driven UA, our business has grown rapidly, freeing us to focus on what we do best: making great games.\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsLumosFunName\":\"Michael Zhao\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsLumosFunTitle\":\"CMO of LumosFun\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsGuruGameQuote\":\"Over the past year, we have doubled our scale and the closed-loop ecosystem of AppLovin Ads and Max has been the greatest catalyst of this success. AppLovin is truly a trusted partner we can count on for long-term growth.\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsGuruGameName\":\"Qi Zhou\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsGuruGameTitle\":\"COO at GuruGame\",\"MonetizationTestimonialsHeading\":\"Big growth stories start with better monetization\",\"NavAdvertiseDescription\":\"with AppLovin Ads\",\"NavMonetizeDescription\":\"with AppLovin Max\",\"ConsumerBrandsFaqTitle\":\"Common questions\",\"GamingAppsFaqTitle\":\"Common questions\",\"MonetizationFaqTitle\":\"Common questions\",\"GameInventoryFaqTitle\":\"Common questions\",\"GameInventoryGamesTitle\":\"There's a game for everyone\",\"GameInventoryGamesBody\":\"AppLovin's inventory spans diverse genres of mobile games. Pick a category to explore some of the titles.\",\"GameInventoryConsumersSpendingPowerBody\":\"Mobile gamers tend to be financially secure consumers who regularly shop online for themselves and their families.\",\"GameInventoryConsumersCaption\":\"Source: Kantar, Mobile Gaming: The New Mainstream Consumer Channel Report\",\"GameInventoryAttentionCard1CtaLabel\":\"Reach them now ↗︎\",\"GameInventoryCtaImageBody\":\"AppLovin ads are fullscreen videos, shown between levels or for in-game rewards. They hold attention for a median of 35 seconds in an environment built for full focus.\",\"AdExperienceScrollMediaTitle\":\"Like a mini TV commercial, but fully measurable\",\"AdExperienceScrollMediaBody\":\"Games hold attention one screen at a time: no feed to scroll, no competing content.\",\"GameInventoryHeroEyebrow\":\"MOBILE GAMING INVENTORY\",\"GameInventoryHeroTitleMain\":\"Where your ads run and\",\"GameInventoryHeroTitleAccent\":\"who they reach\",\"GameInventoryHeroBody\":\"Reach one of the largest consumer audiences in the perfect environment for ads.\",\"GameInventoryHeroPrimaryLabel\":\"Start advertising\",\"GameInventoryConsumersHeadingBillion\":\"1 billion+\",\"GameInventoryConsumersHeadingMain\":\"mainstream consumers\",\"GameInventoryConsumersBody\":\"The person playing a crossword is different from the social media power user. Mobile gamers are parents, professionals, and homeowners who control real household spending.\",\"GameInventoryConsumersDemographicsTitle\":\"Demographics\",\"GameInventoryConsumersDemographicsBody\":\"The mobile gaming audience spans adult age groups and has a balanced gender split.\",\"GameInventoryConsumersSpendingPowerTitle\":\"Spending power\",\"GameInventoryAttentionTitle\":\"A goldmine of untapped attention\",\"GameInventoryAttentionCard1Title\":\"Over 60 minutes of daily play\",\"GameInventoryAttentionCard1Body\":\"The majority of mobile gamers play for over an hour per day while commuting, between meetings, waiting in line, or unwinding at home.\",\"GameInventoryAttentionCard2Title\":\"Your ads get full focus\",\"GameInventoryAttentionCard2Body\":\"Games hold attention one screen at a time: no feed to scroll, no competing content. When an ad appears, it gets undivided attention.\",\"GameInventoryAttentionCard2CtaLabel\":\"Get undivided attention ↗︎\",\"GameInventoryCtaImageTitle\":\"Like a tiny TV commercial, but fully measurable\",\"GameInventoryCtaImagePrimaryLabel\":\"Acquire customers\",\"GameInventoryChipPuzzle\":\"Puzzle\",\"GameInventoryChipMatchSort\":\"Match \u0026 Sort\",\"GameInventoryChipCasualAction\":\"Casual \u0026 Action\",\"GameInventoryChipWordsCards\":\"Words \u0026 Cards\",\"AdExperienceHeroEyebrow\":\"WHY MOBILE GAMES\",\"AdExperienceHeroTitleMain\":\"Ads people actually\\nwatch and\",\"AdExperienceHeroTitleAccent\":\"engage with\",\"AdExperienceHeroBody\":\"AppLovin ads appear in mobile games and get up to 60 seconds of guaranteed attention.\",\"AdExperienceHeroPrimaryLabel\":\"Get started\",\"AdExperienceStatAudienceValue\":\"1B+\",\"AdExperienceStatAudienceLabel\":\"Audience reach\",\"AdExperienceStatMedianWatchValue\":\"35s\",\"AdExperienceStatMedianWatchLabel\":\"Median watch time\",\"AdExperienceStatMinWatchValue\":\"10s\",\"AdExperienceStatMinWatchLabel\":\"Minimum watch time\",\"AdExperienceCarouselTitle\":\"See how brands \\nbring their AppLovin ads to life\",\"AdExperienceCarouselBody\":\" Creating AppLovin ads is easy. Go live in under an hour.\",\"AdExperienceCarouselPrimaryLabel\":\"Start advertising\",\"AdExperienceStep0Eyebrow\":\"BEFORE AD\",\"AdExperienceStep0Title\":\"Gameplay\",\"AdExperienceStep0ChipInterstitial\":\"Interstitial\",\"AdExperienceStep0ChipRewarded\":\"Rewarded\",\"AdExperienceStep0BodyInterstitial\":\"Your ad is shown at natural breaks in gameplay, such as between levels. Users must watch at least five seconds before they can skip.\",\"AdExperienceStep0BodyRewarded\":\"Players choose to watch your ad in exchange for in-game rewards. Once the video begins, it plays through its duration, up to 60 seconds.\",\"AdExperienceStep1Eyebrow\":\"AD · PART 1\",\"AdExperienceStep1Title\":\"Portrait video\",\"AdExperienceStep1Body\":\"The first part of an AppLovin ad is a portrait (9:16) video. It is unskippable for 5 seconds in interstitial placements, and up to 60 seconds in rewarded placements.\",\"AdExperienceStep1PrimaryLabel\":\"Video creative guide\",\"AdExperienceStep2Eyebrow\":\"AD · PART 2\",\"AdExperienceStep2Title\":\"Interactive page\",\"AdExperienceStep2Body\":\"An interactive follows the video and is an additional opportunity to reinforce your message, ensure users remember your brand, and drive engagement.\",\"AdExperienceStep2PrimaryLabel\":\"Interactive creative guide\",\"AdExperienceStep2Accordion1Title\":\"AI-Generated\",\"AdExperienceStep2Accordion1Body\":\"Automatically appear in your account free of charge.\",\"AdExperienceStep2Accordion2Title\":\"AppLovin Creative Studio\",\"AdExperienceStep2Accordion2Body\":\"Build custom interactives with our built-in tools.\",\"AdExperienceStep2Accordion3Title\":\"Existing Assets\",\"AdExperienceStep2Accordion3Body\":\"Use existing 9:16 image assets in this part of the ad experience.\",\"AdExperienceStep3Eyebrow\":\"AD · PART 3\",\"AdExperienceStep3Title\":\"Dynamic catalog\",\"AdExperienceStep3Body\":\"Follows the Interactive with products or offers personalized for each user. Sync your catalog with just a few clicks, and a dynamic catalog is automatically generated.\",\"AdExperienceStep3Bullet1\":\"Products are dynamically selected based on user behavior and intent signals.\",\"AdExperienceStep3Bullet2\":\"Sync your existing product catalog with a few clicks. We handle the rest.\",\"AdExperienceStep3SidebarLabel\":\"Dynamic catalog\",\"BrandHeroTitle\":\"AppLovin Brand\",\"BrandLogoTitle\":\"Logo\",\"BrandLogoBody\":\"These are the primary logos used to represent AppLovin. The full logo should be used whenever possible. The standalone mark is reserved for situations where the AppLovin brand is already well-established, space is limited, or the full logo has already been prominently featured.\\n\\nBy downloading or using any assets from this page, you agree to follow our Brand Guidelines. Please review the guidelines before use to ensure consistent and accurate representation of our brand.\",\"BrandLogoCardLogoLight\":\"Logo - light background\",\"BrandLogoCardMarkLight\":\"Mark - light background\",\"BrandLogoCardLogoDark\":\"Logo - dark background\",\"BrandLogoCardMarkDark\":\"Mark - dark background\",\"BrandLogoCardAgainstGradient\":\"Against gradient\",\"BrandLogoCardAgainstPhoto\":\"Against photo\",\"BrandClearspaceTitle\":\"Clearspace\",\"BrandClearspaceBody\":\"Wherever our logos appear, sufficient clear space should be maintained to ensure visibility and readability. For both the primary logo and the mark, the exclusion zone should be measured using the width of the mark. The full width clearspace is preferred, use half width clearspace when space is limited.\",\"BrandClearspaceCardLogoFull\":\"Logo - full width\",\"BrandClearspaceCardMarkFull\":\"Mark - full width\",\"BrandClearspaceCardLogoHalf\":\"Logo - half width\",\"BrandClearspaceCardMarkHalf\":\"Mark - half width\",\"BrandPartnershipTitle\":\"Partnership\",\"BrandPartnershipBody\":\"When representing a partnership with another company or entity, we use the line symbol to indicate the relationship in a logo lockup for both horizontal and vertical.\",\"BrandPartnershipCardHorizontal\":\"Horizontal\",\"BrandPartnershipCardVertical\":\"Vertical\",\"BrandProductsTitle\":\"Products\",\"BrandProductsBody\":\"AppLovin Ads is our self-serve, AI-powered advertising platform. AppLovin Max is our mobile app monetization platform. Each product logo pairs the AppLovin master logo with a distinctive wordmark.\",\"BrandProductsCardAds\":\"AppLovin Ads\",\"BrandProductsCardMax\":\"AppLovin Max\",\"BrandRestrictionsTitle\":\"What not to do\",\"BrandRestrictionsBody\":\"The logo should never be modified in any way. Below are some common misuses to avoid.\",\"BrandRestrictionsCardColor\":\"Don't change the color of the logo.\",\"BrandRestrictionsCardLowContrast\":\"Don't place the logo on low-contrast background.\",\"BrandRestrictionsCardWordmark\":\"Don't use the wordmark by itself.\",\"BrandRestrictionsCardRotate\":\"Don't rotate the logo.\",\"BrandRestrictionsCardDistort\":\"Don't distort the logo.\",\"BrandRestrictionsCardOutline\":\"Don't outline the logo.\",\"BrandTypographyTitle\":\"Typography\",\"BrandTypographyBody\":\"Mont is our primary typeface for headlines and display content, chosen for its bold geometric structure and modern character. Inter is used for body copy and supporting text, offering exceptional clarity and readability. Together, they create a friendly, refined, and accessible brand voice.\",\"BrandTypographyCardMont\":\"Mont\",\"BrandTypographyCardInter\":\"Inter\",\"BrandTypographyCardNotoKr\":\"Noto Sans CJK KR\",\"BrandTypographyCardNotoJp\":\"Noto Sans CJK JP\",\"BrandTypographyCardNotoSc\":\"Noto Sans CJK SC\",\"BrandTypographyCardNotoVn\":\"Noto Sans\",\"CareersBenefitCNFoodTitle\":\"餐饮支持\",\"CareersBenefitCNFoodBody\":\"让工作更简单，也更高效。\",\"CareersBenefitCNFoodP1\":\"每日健康早餐\",\"CareersBenefitCNFoodP2\":\"100 元/天午餐补贴\",\"CareersBenefitCNFoodP3\":\"免费加班晚餐\",\"CareersBenefitCNFoodP4\":\"每周2次下午茶\",\"CareersBenefitCNCommuteTitle\":\"通勤与生活\",\"CareersBenefitCNCommuteBody\":\"减少通勤时间，把更多时间留给生活。\",\"CareersBenefitCNCommuteP1\":\"4,000 元/月住房补贴（20 分钟通勤范围）\",\"CareersBenefitCNCommuteP2\":\"不限时企业滴滴通勤支持（最高 120 元/天）\",\"CareersBenefitCNCommuteP3\":\"打造更高效的工作节奏\",\"CareersBenefitCNHealthTitle\":\"健康与医疗\",\"CareersBenefitCNHealthBody\":\"健康稳定的状态，是持续创造价值的基础。\",\"CareersBenefitCNHealthP1\":\"10,000 元/年健身福利\",\"CareersBenefitCNHealthP2\":\"高端医疗保险（覆盖私立医院及员工子女）\",\"CareersBenefitCNHealthP3\":\"免费 EAP 心理咨询服务\",\"CareersBenefitCNHealthP4\":\"办公楼内理发、美甲及手部护理服务\",\"CareersBenefitCNFlexibleTitle\":\"灵活福利\",\"CareersBenefitCNFlexibleBody\":\"支持多种生活方式，提供多重福利选择。\",\"CareersBenefitCNFlexibleP1\":\"10,000 元/年旅行福利\",\"CareersBenefitCNFlexibleP2\":\"20,000 元/年灵活福利计划\",\"CareersBenefitCNFlexibleP3\":\"可根据个人需求自由组合旅行、健康、学习、工作设备等不同福利内容\",\"CareersBenefitCNFamilyTitle\":\"家庭关怀\",\"CareersBenefitCNFamilyBody\":\"照顾好员工，也照顾好他们身边最重要的人。\",\"CareersBenefitCNFamilyP1\":\"两位家属年度健康体检\",\"CareersBenefitCNFamilyP2\":\"节日礼盒\",\"CareersBenefitCNFamilyP3\":\"家庭日活动\",\"CareersBenefitCNGlobalTitle\":\"全球成长\",\"CareersBenefitCNGlobalBody\":\"在国际舞台持续创造影响力。\",\"CareersBenefitCNGlobalP1\":\"每年两次赴美国总部交流机会\",\"CareersBenefitCNGlobalP2\":\"国际学术会议支持\",\"CareersBenefitCNGlobalP3\":\"超高规格团建活动\",\"CareersBenefitCNGlobalP4\":\"全球协作与职业发展机会\",\"AboutArticleMessage\":\"“We started as a small business ourselves, so we understand the challenges of growth, the stress of financing, and the thrill of reinvesting profits into expansion. Our team embodies the same mindset that got us here: a humble spirit, a relentless work ethic, a curiosity that drives innovation, and a commitment to challenge the status quo while delivering real, measurable value to you.”\",\"AboutArticleP1\":\"AppLovin, the company behind Axon, started in 2012 with a simple app that let friends share the games they were playing with each other. Like many startups, we needed a way to promote ourselves and grow our users, but the marketing tools at the time didn’t meet our needs. So we pivoted; instead of building just another app, we built a platform to solve the broader marketing challenges we were facing.\",\"AboutArticleP2\":\"For more than a decade, we focused on helping mobile game developers market their apps effectively. Having come from gaming ourselves, we built a network that reached over a billion daily active users through targeted ads in mobile games. It was incredibly rewarding to see how our platform helped studios worldwide scale their businesses, leading to fresh investments, hit game launches, and significant job creation in the industry. Built on the Axon AI technology, this progress naturally evolved into today’s Axon platform.\",\"AboutArticleP3\":\"In 2024, we expanded our vision, believing our marketing tools could benefit businesses beyond gaming. We rolled out an initial version of our solution to e-commerce and direct-to-consumer brands, and the results exceeded our expectations, proving we could drive growth for any business. That momentum fueled the launch of Axon Ads Manager, our self-serve, AI-powered advertising platform. With access to over a billion daily active users and precision targeting designed to drive real results, Axon Ads Manager helps companies reach their ideal customers and make the most of every marketing dollar.\",\"AboutArticleP4\":\"Our goal is to make profitable growth accessible to every business, allowing you to focus on what you do best. As you succeed on our platform, we hope you’ll share your story with us.  Nothing brings us greater joy than celebrating our partners' achievements.\",\"AboutAxonTeam\":\"The Axon Team\",\"AboutCTADescriptionNews\":\"See how Axon is shaping the industry — plus where to find us next\",\"AboutCTATitleNews\":\"News and Events\",\"AboutJobsJoinTeamButton\":\"See open roles\",\"AboutTitle\":\"The Axon Story\",\"AppLovin\":\"AppLovin\",\"BlogsBackToBlog\":\"Back to blog\",\"BlogsDisclaimer\":\"This blog reflects how we think about building products and teams today. It shares perspectives and experiences rather than formal policies or commitments, and our approaches may evolve over time. Descriptions are intentionally high-level and are not meant to represent exhaustive technical, organizational, or product details. Blog posts speak as of the date published and are not subsequently reviewed or maintained. Posts may include forward-looking statements within the meaning of securities law relating to our business and strategies, which are subject to risks disclosed in our SEC filings.\",\"BlogsIndustryNews\":\"Industry News\",\"BlogsLinkCopiedForInstagram\":\"Link and title copied to clipboard! You can now paste it in your Instagram story or bio.\",\"BrandLogoPrimaryLabel\":\"Download\",\"BrandProductsPrimaryLabel\":\"Download\",\"CareersAdamForoughi\":\"Adam Foroughi\",\"CareersAdamForoughiQuote\":\"“We’re defined by the desire to push for more and to continuously improve how we work and evolve what we deliver.”\",\"CareersAdamForoughiTitle\":\"CEO and Co-founder of AppLovin\",\"CareersAlert\":\"AppLovin has become aware of a scam targeting jobseekers with fake \\\"app optimization\\\" and similar roles. We do not ask our candidates to download apps or make any form of payment(s). AppLovin works with applicants through our Jobs page and applovin.com email addresses. If you are contacted through other unofficial channels (such as WhatsApp or Telegram) or asked to download an app or make a payment,  these contacts are not legitimate. Confirm the information here and contact us directly with any questions.\",\"CareersAllOpenPositions\":\"All Open Positions\",\"CareersApplyNow\":\"Apply now\",\"CareersBenefitEligibilityNote\":\"***Please note that our benefits vary by region and employee status. A member of our people team will be able to give you more details on which benefits will be applicable to you\",\"CareersBenefitsDescription\":\"Axon is committed to supporting our employees and their families through our comprehensive benefits program. Our benefits are thoughtfully designed to help you thrive, support your overall health, and to help you reach your goals.\",\"CareersBenefitsTitle\":\"Benefits\",\"CareersCharitableDonation\":\"Charitable donation matching up to US $1,000/yr\",\"CareersDisclaimerP1\":\"AppLovin works with applicants through this Careers page and applovin.com email addresses. If someone reaches out to you through other means, please confirm the information here and contact us directly with any questions.\",\"CareersDisclaimerP2\":\"AppLovin is proud to be an equal opportunity employer that is committed to inclusion and diversity. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status, or other legally protected characteristics.\",\"CareersDisclaimerP2Link\":\"Learn more about EEO rights as an applicant here\",\"CareersDisclaimerP3\":\"If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please send us a request at \u003clink\u003ejobs@applovin.com\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"CareersDisclaimerP4Link\":\"AppLovin will consider for employment all qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with applicable law. If you are applying for a position in California, \u003clink\u003elearn more here\u003c/link\u003e\",\"CareersDisclaimerP5\":\"Read our \u003clink\u003eGlobal Applicant Privacy Notice\u003c/link\u003e  to learn more about how AppLovin processes your personal information.\",\"CareersDisclaimerP6\":\"\u003clink\u003eThis link\u003c/link\u003e leads to the machine-readable files that are made available in response to the federal Transparency in Coverage Rule and includes negotiated service rates and out-of-network allowed amounts between health plans and healthcare providers. The machine-readable files are formatted to allow researchers, regulators, and application developers to more easily access and analyze data.\",\"CareersDoTheThings\":\"Do the things\",\"CareersDoTheThingsDescription\":\"Contribute to real projects, from writing and debugging code to going live. Build features and models that impact business goals.\",\"CareersEmployeeStockPurchasePlan\":\"Employee stock purchase plan\",\"CareersEngineeringDescription\":\"Available now! Accelerate your engineering career with an internship that will give you hands-on experience building the next generation of advanced technology solutions.\",\"CareersEngineeringHeader\":\"Engineering internship\",\"CareersEngineeringTitle\":\"Engineering\",\"CareersFamilyForming\":\"Family forming \u0026 women's reproductive health benefits\",\"CareersFlexibleTimeOff\":\"Flexible time off\",\"CareersGetInThere\":\"Get in there\",\"CareersGetInThereDescription\":\"Jump right in and start building within our fast-paced, startup-style culture. You’re part of the team now!\",\"CareersHeader\":\"Grow without limits\",\"CareersHealthBenefits\":\"100% company paid health benefits for employees \u0026 dependent\",\"CareersHeroDescription\":\"At Axon, we are focused on enabling companies around the world to bring their ideas, products and content to more people - at a massive global scale.\",\"CareersLearnFromTheMasters\":\"Learn from the masters\",\"CareersLearnFromTheMastersDescription\":\"Work alongside industry veterans and leaders, growing your network and learning as you go.\",\"CareersLifeAndDisabilityCoverage\":\"Life and disability coverage\",\"CareersMentalHealth\":\"Access to mental health and wellness provider\",\"CareersOurCultureDescription\":\"We’re all about staying inspired and delivering our best. We strive to surpass the goals we set for ourselves. This means always taking initiative, acting with integrity, and aspiring to greatness.\",\"CareersParentalLeaveProgram\":\"Parental leave program\",\"CareersPhoneBillCovered\":\"Phone bill covered for business usage\",\"CareersRetirementBenefits\":\"Retirement benefits with company matching\",\"CareersTeamCentricCompanyEvents\":\"Team-centric company events and more!\",\"CareersTitle\":\"Careers\",\"CareersTotalJobs\":\"Total Jobs:\",\"ChatResponseError\":\"Sorry, I encountered an error while processing your message.\",\"ChatResponseUnavailable\":\"Apologies, I'm unable to assist right now.\",\"FooterCopyright\":\"© 2025 AppLovin. All rights reserved.\",\"FooterLogIn\":\"Log in\",\"FooterSignUp\":\"Sign up\",\"HomeAlwaysPursueExcellence\":\"Always pursue excellence\",\"HomeChallengeStatusQuo\":\"Challenge the status quo\",\"HomeFoundingPrinciples\":\"Founding principles\",\"HomeLeadByDoing\":\"Lead by doing\",\"HomeNeverStopHustling\":\"Never stop hustling\",\"HomeProductFirst\":\"Product first\",\"HomeSpeedWins\":\"Speed wins\",\"HomeSubtitle\":\"Chat to learn more about Axon\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard1Description\":\"All publishers and advertisers must adhere to AppLovin's \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/terms/\\\"\u003eTerms of Use Agreement\u003c/link\u003e, \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/policies-demand-partners/\\\"\u003ePolicies for Demand Partners\u003c/link\u003e, \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/policies-publishers/\\\"\u003ePolicies for Publishers\u003c/link\u003e, and \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/data-sharing-requirements/\\\"\u003eData Sharing Requirements\u003c/link\u003e.  AppLovin's terms and policies outline our general compliance and data privacy requirements, our expectations for the publisher content and ads available through the Services, including prohibited and restricted content categories, and our prohibitions against invalid traffic (e.g., fake clicks, etc.) or misleading or deceptive experiences.  Through a combination of automated tools and manual review, we actively review the Services for policy violations and take appropriate action consistent with our terms and policies.\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard1Title\":\"Policies and Policy Enforcement\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard2Description\":\"All publishers and advertisers go through AppLovin's account approval process, which includes verification techniques and other measures designed to help ensure the legitimacy and compliance of our publishers and advertisers, the authenticity of their audiences, and the legitimacy of the products and services they promote. If publishers or advertisers do not satisfy these processes, they cannot proceed to onboarding.\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard2Title\":\"Account Approval Process\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard3Description\":\"AppLovin actively monitors and analyzes various metrics to identify fraudulent clicks and impressions, irregular patterns that might indicate invalid traffic, or other indications of invalid activity. We take appropriate action against flagged publishers, consistent with our \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/terms/\\\"\u003eTerms of Use Agreement\u003c/link\u003e and \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/policies-publishers/\\\"\u003ePolicies for Publishers\u003c/link\u003e, including terminating the accounts of publishers flagged for fraudulent or invalid activity. You can learn more about the publisher review process on our \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/introduction-to-applovins-publisher-content-policies/\\\"\u003eIntroduction to AppLovin’s Publisher Content Policies\u003c/link\u003e page.\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard3Title\":\"Publisher Authentication\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard4Description\":\"$28\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard4Title\":\"Automated Ad Review\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard5Description\":\"AppLovin provides an in-ad reporting feature through which end users can directly flag ads served by AppLovin as \\\"inappropriate\\\" or \\\"broken,\\\" and even identify the policies they believe the ads violate.  We review flagged ads and take appropriate action against them, consistent with our \u003clink href=\\\"https://legal.applovin.com/policies-demand-partners/\\\"\u003ePolicies for Demand Partners\u003c/link\u003e.\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard5Title\":\"In-Ad Reporting Tool\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard6Description\":\"AppLovin provides publishers with native tools, including our \u003clink href=\\\"https://support.applovin.com/en/max/ad-review/overview\\\"\u003eAd Review\u003c/link\u003e feature and \u003clink href=\\\"https://support.applovin.com/en/max/android/testing-networks/creative-debugger\\\"\u003eCreative Debugger\u003c/link\u003e, which give publishers readily accessible methods to identify potentially problematic ad content and directly report that content to AppLovin or the relevant network partners for further action.\",\"PlatformEnforcementCard6Title\":\"Ad Review Tools for Publishers\",\"PlatformEnforcementDescription\":\"AppLovin seeks to create a safe, fair, and transparent ecosystem for publishers to monetize their content and for advertisers to reach prospective customers with useful, relevant products and services — while ensuring a safe and positive experience for end users.  We deploy a series of overlapping policy requirements and technical measures to help ensure the validity of our publisher traffic and the quality and content of advertisements, and to help detect and address invalid traffic, spam, and fraud.\",\"PlatformEnforcementSubTitle\":\"These measures include the following:\",\"PlatformEnforcementTitle\":\"Platform Enforcement\",\"The Axon story\":\"The Axon story\"}}},\"locale\":\"en\"},\"children\":\"$L29\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[30399,[\"8784\",\"static/chunks/ced35335-37eb32902b9640e3.js\",\"7935\",\"static/chunks/7935-955bebe88323d641.js\",\"9929\",\"static/chunks/99